00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:31.120
proposed manufacturing facility in India after facing multiple regulatory and logistical obstacles.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:37.080
The decision removes a key piece of the company's strategy for deeper penetration into one of

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:43.160
