00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:19.560
add months or years to timelines. In India, these factors have historically stretched setup periods

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:24.980
well beyond the two-year window Tesla achieved in China, where central coordination and existing

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:31.360
supplier clusters compress the process. Tesla's vertical integration playbook offers one path forward

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:36.180
by bringing more component production in-house and reducing dependence on local partners.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:41.260
Yet that approach still requires stable grid capacity and predictable permitting.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:47.040
With all those foundations, even advanced manufacturing methods cannot fully offset the friction

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:54.300
of entering a new market at scale. Tesla increased prices on several EV models. The move comes as the

00:01:54.300 --> 00:02:00.460
company grapples with rising production costs that have begun to squeeze margins. Higher prices could

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:06.920
